WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:47.152
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:47.422 --> 00:49.841
-Someone stood out to me. -Who?

3
00:49.924 --> 00:51.426
That Rahmboy.

4
00:56.347 --> 00:57.182
Be careful.

5
00:57.265 --> 00:58.600
Especially around Agent Alex.

6
00:58.683 --> 01:01.394
Nothing changes in the plan. We're going through with it.

7
01:05.190 --> 01:07.442
Oh, and Chiara asked me to give this to you.

8
01:22.457 --> 01:26.252
I'm really getting stressed out because of that GAGO.

9
01:30.673 --> 01:33.593
I don't want them to be the only ones having fun.

10
01:37.555 --> 01:39.015
But seriously.

11
01:47.148 --> 01:49.109
I really thought

12
01:49.192 --> 01:52.112
you wouldn't be able to make it to my wedding.

13
02:02.497 --> 02:04.874
She's so beautiful, Viktor. Look at her.

14
02:12.423 --> 02:15.135
This means so much to me, having you here.

15
02:15.218 --> 02:18.888
This might just be the best wedding gift I could ask for.

16
02:21.349 --> 02:22.684
Don't ruin my makeup.

17
02:22.767 --> 02:26.938
Actually, we should be the ones thanking you.

18
02:27.564 --> 02:31.526
Didn't you tell me before that everything is possible?

19
02:33.111 --> 02:36.573
Because of all your sacrifices,

20
02:36.656 --> 02:38.825
for staying with the agency,

21
02:45.331 --> 02:48.167
Your sacrifices were definitely worth it,

22
02:48.251 --> 02:49.544
even with the case your father and I have.

23
02:50.420 --> 02:54.132
It's okay because they understood that we're your parents.

24
02:59.137 --> 03:00.680
then why are you still hurt?

25
03:01.347 --> 03:02.432
Don't worry.

26
03:13.902 --> 03:17.155
I knew he wasn't really a true public servant.

27
03:17.238 --> 03:18.281
Calm down.

28
03:20.867 --> 03:22.285
It's your wedding. Don't stress.

29
03:22.368 --> 03:23.786
-Don't stress, okay? -Yes.

30
03:30.960 --> 03:33.463
I feel so bad that there's nothing I can do.

31
03:34.047 --> 03:35.381
Don't, daughter.

32
03:35.924 --> 03:37.300
We'll handle it, please.

33
03:39.427 --> 03:40.845
Just focus on being happy.

34
03:41.679 --> 03:43.681
We're here to celebrate!

35
03:44.682 --> 03:45.558
Yay!

36
03:46.768 --> 03:50.063
-Thank you! -I’m getting married!

37
04:01.532 --> 04:03.910
Mama Yaya? You mean,

38
04:04.702 --> 04:06.371
La Morte Bianca's Mama Yaya?

39
04:06.454 --> 04:08.873
Your nanny when you trained in Sicily?

40
04:11.125 --> 04:12.377
What is she doing here?

41
04:14.420 --> 04:15.463
She's from Albay too?

42
04:15.546 --> 04:18.132
And she just happens to show up for your wedding?

43
04:19.050 --> 04:20.134
How's Vicky?

44
04:21.636 --> 04:23.096
What's her plan here?

45
04:29.102 --> 04:32.563
Well, whatever Mama Yaya's plan is,

46
04:33.314 --> 04:34.732
that's for her to decide.

47
04:43.074 --> 04:46.327
If there's anything I've learned all these years,

48
05:51.893 --> 05:53.061
Even when it's difficult.

49
05:55.104 --> 05:56.647
Even when it's complicated.

50
06:33.184 --> 06:36.896
And even when the situation is sometimes frightening.

51
06:39.690 --> 06:41.400
But when you love someone,

52
06:42.235 --> 06:45.780
you have to be wholehearted and sincere in your intentions.

53
06:51.744 --> 06:53.496
That the decision you make

54
06:53.579 --> 06:56.457
is for the good of the people you love.

55
07:09.387 --> 07:11.264
Love wears many faces.

56
07:25.069 --> 07:27.780
There are many ways to care

57
07:27.864 --> 07:29.574
and many ways to sacrifice.

58
08:07.111 --> 08:11.616
But why do we always have to choose?

59
08:17.288 --> 08:19.457
There's always a decision to make.

60
09:05.253 --> 09:07.922
And when we make our decisions,

61
09:09.173 --> 09:11.968
we try to choose what's right.

62
09:25.773 --> 09:29.986
We try to do everything we can to make things right.

63
09:48.170 --> 09:49.589
And until the very end,

64
09:53.050 --> 09:55.845
I will choose to love in the only way I know how.

65
09:56.721 --> 09:59.849
For the person I love most.

66
11:31.315 --> 11:34.443
Mr. Mikoy Pinagpala, I will marry you.

67
11:34.527 --> 11:40.241
And I will stay by your side until my very last breath.

68
12:49.602 --> 12:50.644
MJ.

69
12:54.815 --> 12:57.651
Why is it taking so long for the door to open?

70
13:02.615 --> 13:03.616
MJ?

71
13:03.699 --> 13:04.950
MJ.

72
13:05.576 --> 13:07.453
Why is the bride taking so long?

73
13:32.228 --> 13:33.896
Agent Alex is running?

74
14:00.923 --> 14:02.258
Where's Chiara?

75
14:02.341 --> 14:03.676
Why hasn't she come out yet?

76
14:03.759 --> 14:05.344
I don't know either.

77
14:05.427 --> 14:08.264
Maybe there was just a small problem?

78
14:09.515 --> 14:10.724
It can't be a small problem.

79
14:12.851 --> 14:13.978
Let's all calm down first.

80
14:15.020 --> 14:15.980
Stay calm.

81
14:29.577 --> 14:31.537
It's ringing, but no one's answering.

82
14:39.003 --> 14:40.629
Oh my God!

83
14:40.713 --> 14:41.589
What happened?

84
14:42.756 --> 14:44.967
Brother Nanding! Brother Nanding!

85
14:45.050 --> 14:46.302
Where is she?

86
14:46.385 --> 14:47.761
What happened?

87
14:48.429 --> 14:49.555
Sir!

88
14:50.639 --> 14:52.683
MJ! Where's Chiara?

89
14:53.309 --> 14:54.768
Ma'am, I don't know.

90
14:57.229 --> 14:59.273
What’s happening? Everyone's just guessing.

91
15:00.190 --> 15:02.610
I'm already sweating my ass off here!

92
15:02.693 --> 15:04.028
Is the wedding still happening?

93
15:04.111 --> 15:06.822
Of course it is. After everything that's happened, of course it is.

94
15:10.034 --> 15:11.035
Oh, no.

95
15:11.619 --> 15:14.204
Nanding! Oh my God! Oh my God!

96
15:19.001 --> 15:20.169
Where is she?

97
15:20.794 --> 15:23.255
Is our Internet connection the only problem?

98
15:23.839 --> 15:25.507
It looks like it's not, sir.

99
15:26.091 --> 15:28.677
This doesn't look like a simple connection problem.

100
15:28.761 --> 15:30.012
Any update on that?

101
15:31.847 --> 15:34.183
I'm calling Agent Alex, but she's not answering.

102
15:34.767 --> 15:37.519
Okay, hold on. I'll check with Carlota too.

103
15:49.823 --> 15:51.158
It's ringing, but no one's answering.

104
15:52.368 --> 15:53.452
Mikoy.

105
15:53.535 --> 15:55.079
Chiara is missing.

106
15:55.162 --> 15:56.455
She's not in the bridal car either.

107
15:57.873 --> 15:58.707
Are you sure?

108
15:59.917 --> 16:01.210
Where's Chiara?

109
16:01.710 --> 16:03.796
Maybe she just went to the bathroom.

110
16:03.879 --> 16:06.006
Or maybe she forgot something and went back to the hotel.

111
16:06.090 --> 16:07.424
That's possible.

112
16:08.050 --> 16:09.134
It's possible, but…

113
16:09.969 --> 16:10.970
I'm going to find Chiara.

114
16:11.804 --> 16:13.847
-Let's take a look. -What's going on?

115
16:13.931 --> 16:16.600
-Mikoy! -Hey!

116
16:17.351 --> 16:20.771
-Come-- -Mikoy!

117
16:22.106 --> 16:23.065
Mikoy!

118
16:38.956 --> 16:42.042
Thank you so, so much for this day.

119
16:42.835 --> 16:44.920
Please guide us.

120
16:45.004 --> 16:47.589
I know you won't abandon us.

121
16:48.507 --> 16:52.845
You alone know what is meant to happen

122
16:52.928 --> 16:55.848
and when the time is right.

123
16:56.598 --> 16:58.684
What do you mean Chiara is missing? What happened?

124
16:59.351 --> 17:01.311
They said Chiara isn't in the bridal car.

125
17:02.104 --> 17:04.023
They can't get ahold of the driver either.

126
17:05.274 --> 17:06.775
They can't get ahold of the driver?

127
17:08.444 --> 17:09.278
Wait.

128
17:09.361 --> 17:11.030
What's going on, Carlota?

129
17:12.197 --> 17:13.699
According to the wedding planner,

130
17:14.533 --> 17:16.243
the driver was unconscious.

131
17:55.074 --> 17:57.242
Everything scheduled for each hour went as planned.

132
17:58.077 --> 18:01.622
That is, until a few minutes before the bridal march.

133
18:01.705 --> 18:02.956
Oddly,

134
18:03.040 --> 18:05.793
it took a while for the door to open.

135
18:08.670 --> 18:10.130
before everyone started to worry.

136
18:10.214 --> 18:12.132
I immediately followed the wedding planner

137
18:12.216 --> 18:13.884
to personally check on Chiara.

138
18:14.551 --> 18:17.930
At first, we thought the bridal car driver was unconscious.

139
18:18.013 --> 18:19.765
But it turned out he had just fallen asleep.

140
18:20.641 --> 18:21.558
He just fell asleep?

141
18:23.560 --> 18:25.312
Could someone have made him fall asleep?

142
18:30.192 --> 18:32.903
So we didn't let it go. We interrogated him.

143
18:33.487 --> 18:37.950
Nanding, it's impossible for you to just fall asleep while you're at work.

144
18:39.201 --> 18:40.911
I don't know either, ma'am.

145
18:40.994 --> 18:42.371
I just suddenly fell asleep.

146
18:43.038 --> 18:45.374
Nanding, what's the last thing you remember before you fell asleep?

147
18:46.375 --> 18:48.460
Ma'am, we arrived here,

148
18:50.087 --> 18:51.380
and as soon as I got here,

149
18:51.463 --> 18:53.006
I passed out. I fell asleep.

150
18:53.090 --> 18:55.217
I don't remember what happened after that.

151
18:55.300 --> 18:58.887
Did Chiara say anything before you stopped here at the church?

152
18:59.471 --> 19:00.722
No, sir.

153
19:00.806 --> 19:02.349
She didn't say anything to me.

154
19:04.226 --> 19:06.395
My head still hurts badly even now.

155
19:13.402 --> 19:18.157
The bride wasn't coming from that far away from the church.

156
19:25.831 --> 19:28.250
So? Why did the driver fall asleep?

157
19:31.753 --> 19:33.672
We checked his car, sir.

158
19:33.755 --> 19:35.924
It looks like the smart car scent diffuser was the trigger,

159
19:36.008 --> 19:37.259
which caused him to fall asleep.

160
19:37.843 --> 19:39.136
So how?

161
19:39.219 --> 19:42.931
Did someone put sleeping agents in the scent before the wedding?

162
19:43.015 --> 19:45.601
If someone put the driver to sleep,

163
19:46.685 --> 19:49.313
does that mean Chiara was kidnapped?

164
19:57.529 --> 19:59.031
Chiara could have been the one who sprayed it.

165
19:59.531 --> 20:01.491
Why would she do that?

166
20:05.120 --> 20:08.165
Could she have gotten cold feet at the last minute

167
20:08.248 --> 20:09.666
and wanted to run away?

168
20:13.170 --> 20:14.630
that does happen.

169
20:17.382 --> 20:18.717
That seems impossible.

170
20:20.636 --> 20:22.512
After everything they've been through,

171
20:23.472 --> 20:25.557
would she really have doubts now?

172
20:29.478 --> 20:33.023
if she has an issue or a concern, she'll tell you about it directly.

173
20:34.483 --> 20:36.526
If she had any doubts before the wedding,

174
20:37.694 --> 20:41.323
I'm sure she would've brought them up with Mikoy so they could talk about it.

175
20:42.407 --> 20:44.409
That's exactly what Mikoy said too, sir.

176
20:44.993 --> 20:46.995
Even when their preparations got stressful,

177
20:47.955 --> 20:50.165
they were open and transparent with each other.

178
20:50.249 --> 20:52.584
And they made sure to discuss everything.

179
20:57.381 --> 21:00.092
we know that she's the kind of person

180
21:00.175 --> 21:04.972
who can make decisions and make moves without telling anyone.

181
21:08.100 --> 21:09.559
Chiara has a history of doing that.

182
21:10.852 --> 21:11.979
But this is different.

183
21:12.813 --> 21:14.815
This was supposed to be her wedding to Mikoy.

184
21:14.898 --> 21:17.276
This was something they prepared for together.

185
21:18.568 --> 21:22.197
It seems out of character for her to suddenly make a move on her own.

186
21:23.365 --> 21:27.411
We also talked to everyone who interacted with Chiara.

187
21:27.494 --> 21:28.870
From the glam team,

188
21:28.954 --> 21:31.415
the person who made her gown, the photographer,

189
21:31.498 --> 21:34.459
all the hotel staff who were on duty that morning.

190
21:34.543 --> 21:37.379
Even all the guests who saw her.

191
21:38.213 --> 21:40.549
None of them noticed anything unusual.

192
21:40.632 --> 21:43.552
In fact, they all said the same thing.

193
21:44.094 --> 21:48.890
That Chiara was a beautiful and excited bride.

194
21:49.891 --> 21:52.436
What time was the last time you saw Chiara?

195
21:52.978 --> 21:55.897
Actually, I was with her about 30 minutes ago.

196
21:55.981 --> 21:58.984
We even double-checked her dress.

197
21:59.067 --> 22:01.361
Then I helped her into the car.

198
22:01.445 --> 22:03.697
What did you notice about her mindset, about how she was feeling?

199
22:03.780 --> 22:05.574
Was she happy? Sad? Angry?

200
22:05.657 --> 22:08.243
She was so happy, really excited about her dress.

201
22:08.327 --> 22:10.996
She was so excited. I don't know, my goodness!

202
22:11.079 --> 22:13.999
Did you leave her there, or did she leave the place herself?

203
22:14.082 --> 22:16.835
Once she got into the bridal car,

204
22:16.918 --> 22:17.794
that was it.

205
22:17.878 --> 22:18.712
-That was the last time we saw her. -That was the last time you saw her.

206
22:18.795 --> 22:20.047
How many minutes ago was that?

207
22:21.548 --> 22:23.717
Aside from going to Mikoy's house,

208
22:23.800 --> 22:27.054
we also checked the CCTV footage from the church and the hotel.

209
22:35.437 --> 22:37.397
But Chiara never returned to the hotel.

210
22:37.481 --> 22:39.691
And she never got out of the bridal car either.

211
22:50.243 --> 22:54.706
Mario also helped us ask around for help.

212
22:54.790 --> 22:58.043
In case they saw anything or noticed anything unusual.

213
22:58.126 --> 23:01.755
You don't have any leads or anything from your informants?

214
23:02.339 --> 23:03.548
I'm sorry, Mario,

215
23:03.632 --> 23:06.218
but as of now, we can't say that

216
23:06.301 --> 23:08.136
Chiara Valtrovi is a missing person.

217
23:08.220 --> 23:10.013
That's because of the 24-hour window.

218
23:10.097 --> 23:12.849
But a lot can happen within 24 hours.

219
23:12.933 --> 23:14.643
We can't just sit around and do nothing.

220
23:14.726 --> 23:16.645
With all due respect, Mario,

221
23:17.187 --> 23:19.439
this could be a case of a runaway bride.

222
23:19.523 --> 23:20.899
And besides, Mario,

223
23:20.982 --> 23:24.444
it's no secret that the bride was once part of the mafia.

224
23:25.028 --> 23:27.614
Maybe, you know,

225
23:27.697 --> 23:29.616
she went back to her old life.

226
23:31.535 --> 23:34.079
It's not officially confirmed yet that

227
23:34.162 --> 23:36.373
Chiara is a missing person.

228
23:36.456 --> 23:37.791
What's important is,

229
23:37.874 --> 23:40.043
all the police have been alerted at every checkpoint

230
23:40.127 --> 23:42.254
to watch out for Chiara.

231
23:42.337 --> 23:44.798
We also spoke to Donabel and Viktor.

232
23:45.423 --> 23:48.176
They spoke as a family before Chiara left the hotel.

233
23:48.677 --> 23:49.886
Papa Vik.

234
23:49.970 --> 23:51.429
Mama Donabel.

235
23:51.513 --> 23:53.265
How was your conversation with Chiara?

236
23:54.641 --> 23:56.560
It was okay, Mikoy.

237
23:56.643 --> 23:58.436
Just a brief catch-up.

238
24:03.775 --> 24:04.860
Yes.

239
24:04.943 --> 24:07.445
Our little reunion was cut short.

240
24:08.238 --> 24:10.699
Did she mention anything that was bothering her?

241
24:10.782 --> 24:12.951
Or did you notice anything unusual about her?

242
24:13.785 --> 24:14.911
Nothing.

243
24:15.579 --> 24:17.455
Chiara actually seemed so happy.

244
24:17.539 --> 24:19.374
And she even said, didn't she, that

245
24:19.457 --> 24:21.877
love is ultimately a decision.

246
24:22.794 --> 24:24.129
So,

247
24:24.212 --> 24:26.673
she was completely committed to marrying you.

248
24:26.756 --> 24:28.717
To spend the rest of her life with you.

249
24:29.593 --> 24:31.094
Viktor, what happened to our daughter?

250
24:31.178 --> 24:32.721
Where's Chiara now?

251
24:36.224 --> 24:38.059
Viktor, during your brief conversation with Chiara,

252
24:38.143 --> 24:39.477
did she mention anything?

253
24:41.229 --> 24:42.063
Did she mention anyone?

254
24:42.147 --> 24:43.148
Anything at all.

255
24:43.231 --> 24:45.025
A person, someone she knew, or an event.

256
24:45.609 --> 24:47.402
Nothing, Agent Alex.

257
25:30.528 --> 25:31.738
Chiara is missing.

258
25:31.821 --> 25:33.073
I don’t know where to start.

259
25:33.156 --> 25:35.617
But maybe you have to rest first.

260
25:35.700 --> 25:37.118
But we’re wasting so much time!

261
25:37.202 --> 25:39.037
I think Tess is right.

262
25:39.120 --> 25:40.330
You better rest first.

263
25:40.413 --> 25:44.459
Mom. Chiara might be in more danger if we stop searching.

264
25:48.213 --> 25:50.215
I have so many secrets to hide

265
25:50.298 --> 25:54.052
just to give our family a simple life, Mikoy.

266
25:54.135 --> 25:57.514
Because of that, I feel like fate is making me pay.

267
25:58.098 --> 26:01.476
Only if you knew, it’s so hard for me to see you suffer.

268
26:01.559 --> 26:03.228
You’re a good person, my son.

269
26:03.311 --> 26:05.438
And I will do everything just to help you.

270
26:06.898 --> 26:08.400
Sean is talking to someone suspicious.

271
26:08.483 --> 26:11.111
There’s a new character in Chiara and Mikoy’s life.

272
26:11.194 --> 26:13.363
And now she’s a running away bride?

273
26:16.616 --> 26:19.286
This Vicky should be investigated.

274
26:20.578 --> 26:22.747
Is there’s still no news about my daughter?

275
26:22.831 --> 26:24.082
For now, none.

276
26:24.165 --> 26:27.002
Chiara is not someone who will just disappear.

277
26:27.085 --> 26:28.628
I think there’s something that happened.
